  "body": "Vendor has purchased and is ready to meet the market. Ignore all previous price indications. \r\n\r\nMake your lifestyle move and step into effortless, sophisticated single level living in this beautifully renovated home a short level walk to Manly Beach.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n-Substantial (329sqm more or less) and sophisticated and effortless single level living\r\n-Large second living space - ideal for families and teenagers\r\n-Substantial 3 car garaging with extra storage and workshop space\r\n-Beautifully appointed bathrooms\r\n-Spacious and private master suite with luxurious walk-in dressing room\r\n-Short, level walk to Manly Beach\r\n-Private outdoor entertaining spaces\r\n-Ample off-street parking for the caravan, boat and tractor\r\n-Multiple fruit trees including avocado, apple, pear, lemon, lime, feijoa, plum, orange and mandarin\r\n-Fully fenced with automated gate\r\n-Large land holding with room for a pool\r\n-Solar power and two hot water cylinders\r\n\r\nBoasting four spacious bedrooms, a dedicated office and garaging galore, this exceptional property has been designed for modern family living without compromising on style.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is a stunning stylish kitchen and family area. The magnificent master suite is a highlight of the home, complete with a spacious and luxurious walk-in dressing room that dreams are made of.\r\n\r\nAnd for those who value space and storage, the triple-car internal access garage is a rare and highly desirable feature, complemented by plenty of additional off-street parking.\r\n\r\nThen there’s the lifestyle. Walk to the beach, local schools, shops and everyday amenities, while enjoying everything that the vibrant Manly community has to offer. And with the Penlink project set to further improve connectivity to the Hibiscus Coast and Auckland, this is a location where both lifestyle and future convenience are strongly positioned.\r\n\r\nBeautifully renovated, effortlessly stylish and superbly positioned, this is more than a home — it’s a lifestyle. Vendor has purchased and is ready to meet the market. CV $2,250,000",
